# Images:
The logo is an oval shape with a reddish-brown outer border and a lime green inner border. Inside the oval, "AL-FAROOQ" is written in large, bold letters, with "AL-" in lime green and "FAROOQ" in reddish-brown. Two green leaves are positioned above and to the left of "AL-FAROOQ". A lime green horizontal line separates "AL-FAROOQ" from "FOODS," which is written in bold, reddish-brown capital letters below the line.